cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it using these metadata."
title: "COSMO Suite framework"
abstract: >-
  A reusable Software-as-a-Service framework that turns scientific Python code into
  browser-based applications. It provides the application shell, Pydantic-driven form
  generation, asynchronous job execution via Celery, persistence in PostgreSQL and
  S3-compatible object storage, while the scientific method stays in an independent
  computation module. Ships with a reference domain, a CSV statistical profiler, that
  demonstrates the integration.
